\\,{45x-180}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,175\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{2}+11x+45 \\\\  & x-4\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}+x-5\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}-16{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,11{x}^{2}+x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{11{x}^{2}-44x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,45x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{45x-180}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,175\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are \n\n$\\,$ $4{x}^{2}+11x+45\\,$ and $\\,11{x}^{2}+x-5.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-113746/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "dd4abd5d-2642-5f0d-af2f-5ed5c265526a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113746"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-105589/selection/46b84d6bbb6e2177c93852c87c30b5f3dca0af187d1e394dc18b1693a0fead26" :answer/id #uuid "df0cddf9-56d1-56ba-a204-ad5166bbd863" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$11{x}^{2}+10x+33\\,$ and $\\,10{x}^{2}+13x-14$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105589/selection/92c4ffbca544e9f1932657da6b6482142eb9fc90fa85cbf118d7b3569cb694ca" :answer/id #uuid "f5222a89-3a2d-52fb-ac9a-41387f691d48" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$11{x}^{2}+20x-28\\,$ and $\\,20{x}^{2}-12x+14$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105589/selection/2fbd4d4650c72387aa43682dc335a0b678ddb323422daa3ecb1a49e707b36849" :answer/id #uuid "12dc4dce-da1d-51dd-b557-2472505df2bc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value