question/math-academy-id "q-38108" :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & x+4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{2}+0x+16} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{2}+4x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,4x-16}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,32\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x$-term. So, we write it using a zero coefficient, as follows:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+0x+16\n$$\n\nUsing the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x-4 \\\\  & x+4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{2}+0x+16} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{2}+4x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,4x+16 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,4x-16}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,32\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are\n\n$\\,$ $x-4\\,$ and $\\,-4x+16.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-38108/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26c342f1-881b-5f3e-8c76-448eec165168"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-38108"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-104226"] :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & 2x+10\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{2}+0x-5} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{2}+20x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-20x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\boxed{}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,95\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x$-term. So, we write it using a zero coefficient, as follows:\n\n$$\n4{x}^{2}+0x-5\n$$\n\nUsing the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-10 \\\\  & 2x+10\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{2}+0x-5} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{2}+20x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-20x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,20x-100}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,95\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are\n\n$\\,$ $2x-10\\,$ and $\\,-20x-100.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-114262/selection/c06437e33a10677faa5407f60773177eb989c3b51560c133027e6944f72cc93d" :answer/id #uuid "491186b9-9d6f-57d3-9096-4df6e5140098" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$6x+36\\,$ and $\\,36x-4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114262/selection/57f1f55e2282d2e0948a818e2f9cd99bc0b2f907316bcb52daac78c375cf7300" :answer/id #uuid "c5b7577e-41df-517b-8390-357ccd512d9e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$6x-24\\,$ and $\\,24x-4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114262/selection/630f2cd980bb1ba8a4b6c2ba6dfefbc8c136e581472a829f75e81d9e3586fe46" :answer/id #uuid "501d83cb-89e3-5346-b6b5-c842130b0412" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$6x+30\\,$ and $\\,30x-6$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114262/selection/a42021dc8ad4ca4d35804424927cd1e13bdeac714ddbdc85947113b729510767" :answer/id #uuid "b254bc39-624a-53d0-af90-095fd3948c52" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$6x-36\\,$ and $\\,48x-4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114262/selection/4efe5d94e7efe39cff17f9b31932f95c28360fba664825a4ea1832f74fd07fdb" :answer/id #uuid "b97b39da-035e-5025-98cd-aad9a8f6d12e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$6x+48\\,$ and $\\,48x-8$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114262/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "424ef1ac-66b8-5c64-8fb2-4d17ef24ef56" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114262/selection/c06437e33a10677faa5407f60773177eb989c3b51560c133027e6944f72cc93d" :answer-field/choices ["q-114262/selection/c06437e33a10677faa5407f60773177eb989c3b51560c133027e6944f72cc93d" "q-114262/selection/57f1f55e2282d2e0948a818e2f9cd99bc0b2f907316bcb52daac78c375cf7300" "q-114262/selection/630f2cd980bb1ba8a4b6c2ba6dfefbc8c136e581472a829f75e81d9e3586fe46" "q-114262/selection/a42021dc8ad4ca4d35804424927cd1e13bdeac714ddbdc85947113b729510767" "q-114262/selection/4efe5d94e7efe39cff17f9b31932f95c28360fba664825a4ea1832f74fd07fdb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114262" :question/id #uuid "3536c096-9c19-5ecb-8cd6-bf3a33c8475e" :question/math-academy-id "q-114262" :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & x-6\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,6{x}^{2}+0x-4} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{2}-36x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{36x-216}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,212\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x$-term. So, we write it using a zero coefficient, as follows: \n\n$$\n6{x}^{2}+0x-4\n$$\n\nUsing the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6x+36 \\\\  & x-6\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,6{x}^{2}+0x-4} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{2}-36x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,36x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{36x-216}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,212\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are\n\n$\\,$ $6x+36\\,$ and $\\,36x-4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-114262/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26c342f1-881b-5f3e-8c76-448eec165168"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114262"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114266/selection/1e206bf44d8caf9439799ac2c64e9963babbcdbe4958abac7d2e60d8aa348f09" :answer/id #uuid "7b314669-ff86-5107-8d01-40f4bab1dc10" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${x}^{2}-4x+6\\,$ and $\\,8{x}^{2}-15x$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114266/selection/e930d7ec6e8a6951e1a385a73d3713541a8fd6160929485b2a2c05a7ed6df9ec" :answer/id #uuid "f05b14b9-44a0-534c-9e8d-62503e3e1fda" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${x}^{2}-8x+5\\,$ and $\\,-6{x}^{2}-4x$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114266/selection/e9a96c246aca2bb24cef3374c40386b6b24d96d0f2c096238c2168c5a0cc3a65" :answer/id #uuid "31b9b86d-390c-5fd7-9e81-6e1218192e2f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${x}^{2}-6x+3\\,$ and $\\,-6{x}^{2}-8x$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114266/selection/2314bfa69eac496be604db02ae627e82e835fb4cd756851550480e98a9cbae4a" :answer/id #uuid "2478f688-4233-5395-a8bb-99eaf7c3b2c7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${x}^{2}+4x+4\\,$ and $\\,8{x}^{2}-10x$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114266/selection/731a690eb8110bbfd664adb38da5b765b64a998c8c7afd0030f889858ed625cf" :answer/id #uuid "1c4948d4-290d-5b28-8106-77aa70068141" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "${x}^{2}-2x+3\\,$ and $\\,-8{x}^{2}-12x$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114266/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d083392a-d05b-543c-8bd4-c59dc28a6e6b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114266/selection/731a690eb8110bbfd664adb38da5b765b64a998c8c7afd0030f889858ed625cf" :answer-field/choices ["q-114266/selection/1e206bf44d8caf9439799ac2c64e9963babbcdbe4958abac7d2e60d8aa348f09" "q-114266/selection/e930d7ec6e8a6951e1a385a73d3713541a8fd6160929485b2a2c05a7ed6df9ec" "q-114266/selection/e9a96c246aca2bb24cef3374c40386b6b24d96d0f2c096238c2168c5a0cc3a65" "q-114266/selection/2314bfa69eac496be604db02ae627e82e835fb4cd756851550480e98a9cbae4a" "q-114266/selection/731a690eb8110bbfd664adb38da5b765b64a998c8c7afd0030f889858ed625cf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114266" :question/id #uuid "252c7219-93b7-53af-acf7-f0168872d045" :question/math-academy-id "q-114266" :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & 4x+6\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+0x+8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,8{x}^{2}+0x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\boxed{}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,12x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{12x+18}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,10\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x$-term. So, we write it using a zero coefficient, as follows:\n\n$$\n4{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+0x+8\n$$\n\nUsing the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-2x+3 \\\\  & 4x+6\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+0x+8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,8{x}^{2}+0x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,8{x}^{2}-12x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,12x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{12x+18}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are\n\n$\\,$ ${x}^{2}-2x+3\\,$ and $\\,-8{x}^{2}-12x.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-114266/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26c342f1-881b-5f3e-8c76-448eec165168"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114266"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-5032"] :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{\\text{[math]\\phantom{2x+20}[/math]}} \\\\  & x-4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+12x+25\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}-\\,\\,8x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{\\text{[math]\\phantom{20x+25}[/math]}} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{20x-80}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,105 \\\\  & \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x+20 \\\\  & x-4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+12x+25\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}-\\,\\,8x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,20x+25 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{20x-80}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,105 \\\\  & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are $2x+20$ and $20x+25.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-5110"] :question/problem "Consider the following polynomial division:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-2 \\\\  & x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+8x-5\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}+10x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-2x-10}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the above, what is $\\dfrac{2x^2+8x-5}{x+5}?$" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-2 \\\\  & x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+8x-5\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}+10x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-2x-10}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the given polynomial division, we deduce that dividing the polynomial $2x^2+8x -5$ by the linear binomial ${\\color{purple}x+5}$ gives\n\n- the quotient ${\\color{blue}2x-2},$ and\n\n- the remainder ${\\color{red}5}.$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^2+8x-5}{x+5} = {\\color{blue}2x-2}+\\dfrac{\\color{red}5}{\\color{purple}x+5}.\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-5033"] :question/problem "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{\\text{[math]\\phantom{x^2 - x + 1}[/math]}} \\\\  & x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+64\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,{x}^{2}+0x+64 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,{x}^{2}-x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{\\text{[math]\\phantom{x + 64}[/math]}} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x+1}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,63\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x^2$-term and the $x$-term. So, we write it using zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\nx^3+{\\color{red}0}x^2 + {\\color{red}0}x + 64\n$$\n\nUsing the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-x+1 \\\\  & x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+64\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,{x}^{2}+0x+64 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,{x}^{2}-x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x+64 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x+1}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,63\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the missing expressions are\n\n$\\qquad$ $x^2 - x + 1\\quad$ and $\\quad x + 64.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
